        "id": 190369,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-22T13:52:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We never said we were a smart group =P</p><p>We didn't see any really bad nemesis that made Glamour's presence especially terrible (maybe Judge Mental). The worst part was having AbZeros AoE in play, but we made sure AbZero had Twist the Ether to make that redirection not hurt us, and didn't play Legacy's or Zeros damage increases until late in the game when we were racing against the clock. We just focused on the Villain HPs for the most part as the best path to win, though trying to focus Biomancer first is difficult no matter how you slice it with his passive DR (of which the AoE ongoings for Visionary and AbZero were very much needed)</p>",
